<h3 data-start=3D"6244" data-end=3D"6270" class=3D"">e. <strong data-start=
=3D"6251" data-end=3D"6270">Spring Security</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6272" data-end=3D"6416" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
272" data-end=3D"6291">Spring Security</strong> est un framework qui permet=
 de s=C3=A9curiser les applications. Il offre des solutions pour l'authenti=
fication et l'autorisation.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6418" data-end=3D"6617">
<li data-start=3D"6418" data-end=3D"6508" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6420" data-end=3D"6508" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
420" data-end=3D"6440">Authentification</strong> : Spring Security permet d=
e g=C3=A9rer les utilisateurs et les sessions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6509" data-end=3D"6617" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6511" data-end=3D"6617" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
511" data-end=3D"6527">Autorisation</strong> : Vous pouvez d=C3=A9finir des=
 r=C3=B4les et des permissions pour contr=C3=B4ler l'acc=C3=A8s aux ressour=
ces.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6619" data-end=3D"6664" class=3D"">f. <strong data-start=
=3D"6626" data-end=3D"6664">Spring Batch et Spring Integration</strong></h3=
>
