<hr data-start=3D"9945" data-end=3D"9948" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9950" data-end=3D"9987" class=3D"">10. Conclusion et bonn=
es pratiques</h2>
<p data-start=3D"9989" data-end=3D"10177" class=3D"">Vous avez maintenant c=
onfigur=C3=A9 un environnement de d=C3=A9veloppement Java complet, adapt=C3=
=A9 pour d=C3=A9velopper des applications Java simples ou complexes. Voici =
quelques bonnes pratiques =C3=A0 suivre :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"10179" data-end=3D"10520">
<li data-start=3D"10179" data-end=3D"10273" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"10181" data-end=3D"10273" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D=
"10181" data-end=3D"10216">Utilisez un contr=C3=B4le de version</strong> (G=
it) pour g=C3=A9rer les diff=C3=A9rentes versions de votre code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10274" data-end=3D"10345" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"10276" data-end=3D"10345" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D=
"10276" data-end=3D"10300">Testez r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rement</strong> votre co=
