<p data-start=3D"4544" data-end=3D"4627" class=3D"">Sous <strong data-start=
=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4574">Java &gt; Installed JREs</strong>, v=C3=A9rifie=
z que votre version du JDK est s=C3=A9lectionn=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4629" data-end=3D"4676" class=3D"">4.2. Configuration du =
proxy (si n=C3=A9cessaire)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4677" data-end=3D"4801" class=3D"">Si vous =C3=AAtes derri=
=C3=A8re un proxy (dans un environnement d'entreprise, par exemple), vous d=
evrez configurer le proxy dans STS :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4803" data-end=3D"4923">
<li data-start=3D"4803" data-end=3D"4842" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4806" data-end=3D"4842" class=3D"">Allez dans <strong data=
-start=3D"4817" data-end=3D"4841">Window &gt; Preferences</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4843" data-end=3D"4923" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4846" data-end=3D"4923" class=3D"">Sous <strong data-start=
=3D"4851" data-end=3D"4884">General &gt; Network Connections</strong>, conf=
igurez votre proxy HTTP ou HTTPS.</p>
