<hr data-start=3D"6255" data-end=3D"6258" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6260" data-end=3D"6287" class=3D"">3. IoC et DI dans Spri=
ng</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6289" data-end=3D"6325" class=3D"">3.1. Cr=C3=A9ation d'u=
n conteneur IoC</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6327" data-end=3D"6402" class=3D"">Spring fournit un conte=
neur IoC qui peut =C3=AAtre configur=C3=A9 de trois mani=C3=A8res :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6403" data-end=3D"6619">
<li data-start=3D"6403" data-end=3D"6453" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6405" data-end=3D"6453" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
405" data-end=3D"6412">XML</strong> : Une ancienne m=C3=A9thode de configur=
ation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6454" data-end=3D"6540" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6456" data-end=3D"6540" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
456" data-end=3D"6471">Annotations</strong> : Utilisation des annotations c=
omme <code data-start=3D"6508" data-end=3D"6520">@Component</code>, <code d=
ata-start=3D"6522" data-end=3D"6534">@Autowired</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6541" data-end=3D"6619" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6543" data-end=3D"6619" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
543" data-end=3D"6558">Java Config</strong> : Utilisation des classes Java =
pour configurer le conteneur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6621" data-end=3D"6660" class=3D"">3.2. Configuration des=
 Beans Spring</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6662" data-end=3D"6788" class=3D"">Les Beans dans Spring p=
euvent =C3=AAtre configur=C3=A9s de mani=C3=A8re explicite =C3=A0 l=E2=80=
=99aide de fichiers XML, de classes Java ou d=E2=80=99annotations.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6790" data-end=3D"6821" class=3D"">Exemple avec annotatio=
ns :</h4>
<pre class=3D"!overflow-visible" data-start=3D"6822" data-end=3D"6970"><div=
 class=3D"contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border=
-medium relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary"><div class=3D"flex items=
