<h3 data-start=3D"6482" data-end=3D"6540" class=3D"">3.2. Interfaces <code =
data-start=3D"6502" data-end=3D"6520">InitializingBean</code> et <code data=
-start=3D"6524" data-end=3D"6540">DisposableBean</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6542" data-end=3D"6652" class=3D"">Spring propose deux int=
erfaces qui peuvent =C3=AAtre impl=C3=A9ment=C3=A9es par un bean pour perso=
nnaliser son cycle de vie :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6653" data-end=3D"6870">
<li data-start=3D"6653" data-end=3D"6751" class=3D"">
