655" data-end=3D"6677"><code data-start=3D"6657" data-end=3D"6675">Initiali=
zingBean</code></strong> : Impl=C3=A9mentez la m=C3=A9thode <code data-star=
t=3D"6703" data-end=3D"6725">afterPropertiesSet()</code> pour initialiser l=
e bean.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6752" data-end=3D"6870" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6754" data-end=3D"6870" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
754" data-end=3D"6774"><code data-start=3D"6756" data-end=3D"6772">Disposab=
leBean</code></strong> : Impl=C3=A9mentez la m=C3=A9thode <code data-start=
=3D"6800" data-end=3D"6811">destroy()</code> pour nettoyer les ressources a=
vant la destruction du bean.</p>
</li>
</ul>
