<h3 data-start=3D"6930" data-end=3D"6948" class=3D"">Explications :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6949" data-end=3D"7257">
<li data-start=3D"6949" data-end=3D"7029" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6951" data-end=3D"7029" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
951" data-end=3D"6993">EntityManager.getTransaction().begin()</strong> : D=
=C3=A9marre une nouvelle transaction.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7030" data-end=3D"7132" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7032" data-end=3D"7132" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
032" data-end=3D"7075">EntityManager.getTransaction().commit()</strong> : V=
alide la transaction en enregistrant les changements.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7133" data-end=3D"7257" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7135" data-end=3D"7257" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
135" data-end=3D"7180">EntityManager.getTransaction().rollback()</strong> :=
 Annule les changements si une exception est lanc=C3=A9e pendant la transac=
tion.</p>
</li>
</ul>
