transaction. Si la m=C3=A9thode r=C3=A9ussit, la transaction sera valid=C3=
=A9e. Si une exception est lanc=C3=A9e, Spring effectuera un rollback.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8643" data-end=3D"8844" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8645" data-end=3D"8844" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
