<h4 data-start=3D"6348" data-end=3D"6369" class=3D"">2. <strong data-start=
=3D"6356" data-end=3D"6369">isolation</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"6371" data-end=3D"6534" class=3D"">D=C3=A9finit le niveau =
d'<strong data-start=3D"6391" data-end=3D"6404">isolation</strong> de la tr=
ansaction, qui d=C3=A9termine comment les donn=C3=A9es sont visibles pour d=
'autres transactions. Les niveaux d=E2=80=99isolation incluent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6536" data-end=3D"7027">
<li data-start=3D"6536" data-end=3D"6652" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6538" data-end=3D"6652" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
538" data-end=3D"6558">READ_UNCOMMITTED</strong> : Permet la lecture de don=
n=C3=A9es non valid=C3=A9es, ce qui peut entra=C3=AEner des r=C3=A9sultats =
incoh=C3=A9rents.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6653" data-end=3D"6811" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6655" data-end=3D"6811" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
655" data-end=3D"6673">READ_COMMITTED</strong> (par d=C3=A9faut) : Les donn=
=C3=A9es lues sont valid=C3=A9es, mais d'autres transactions peuvent les mo=
difier avant que la transaction ne soit termin=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6812" data-end=3D"6940" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6814" data-end=3D"6940" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
814" data-end=3D"6833">REPEATABLE_READ</strong> : Les donn=C3=A9es lues ne =
peuvent pas =C3=AAtre modifi=C3=A9es par d'autres transactions avant la fin=
 de la transaction.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6941" data-end=3D"7027" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6943" data-end=3D"7027" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
943" data-end=3D"6959">SERIALIZABLE</strong> : Le niveau d'isolation le plu=
s =C3=A9lev=C3=A9, emp=C3=AAchant toute concurrence.</p>
</li>
</ul>
