<p data-start=3D"4995" data-end=3D"5093" class=3D"">La seule annotation <co=
de data-start=3D"5015" data-end=3D"5039">@EnableBatchProcessing</code> acti=
ve la configuration par d=C3=A9faut pour Spring Batch.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5095" data-end=3D"5098" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5100" data-end=3D"5138" class=3D"">3. Concepts de base de=
 Spring Batch</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5140" data-end=3D"5315" class=3D"">Spring Batch repose sur=
 plusieurs concepts cl=C3=A9s, notamment <strong data-start=3D"5199" data-e=
nd=3D"5206">Job</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"5208" data-end=3D"5216">Ste=
p</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"5218" data-end=3D"5232">ItemReader</stron=
g>, <strong data-start=3D"5234" data-end=3D"5251">ItemProcessor</strong>, e=
t <strong data-start=3D"5256" data-end=3D"5270">ItemWriter</strong>. Voici =
un aper=C3=A7u de chacun de ces =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments :</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5317" data-end=3D"5324" class=3D"">Job</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5325" data-end=3D"5560" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"5328" data-end=3D"5335">Job</strong> repr=C3=A9sente une t=C3=A2che glo=
bale qui sera ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9e. Il contient une ou plusieurs =C3=A9tapes =
qui composent le flux de traitement. Un job est ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 de mani=
=C3=A8re atomique, c=E2=80=99est-=C3=A0-dire que si une =C3=A9tape =C3=A9ch=
oue, l=E2=80=99ensemble du job =C3=A9choue.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5562" data-end=3D"5570" class=3D"">Step</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5571" data-end=3D"5808" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"5574" data-end=3D"5582">Step</strong> est une =C3=A9tape dans un <stron=
g data-start=3D"5605" data-end=3D"5612">Job</strong>. Chaque <strong data-s=
tart=3D"5621" data-end=3D"5629">Step</strong> repr=C3=A9sente une unit=C3=
=A9 de travail. Un <strong data-start=3D"5666" data-end=3D"5674">Step</stro=
ng> peut =C3=AAtre un simple traitement de donn=C3=A9es ou une s=C3=A9rie d=
=E2=80=99actions complexes comme la lecture, le traitement, et l=E2=80=99=
=C3=A9criture de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5810" data-end=3D"5824" class=3D"">ItemReader</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5825" data-end=3D"6004" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99<strong data-=
start=3D"5827" data-end=3D"5841">ItemReader</strong> est responsable de la =
lecture des donn=C3=A9es =C3=A0 traiter. Cela peut =C3=AAtre la lecture de =
donn=C3=A9es depuis une base de donn=C3=A9es, un fichier, ou tout autre sou=
rce de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6006" data-end=3D"6023" class=3D"">ItemProcessor</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6024" data-end=3D"6216" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99<strong data-=
start=3D"6026" data-end=3D"6043">ItemProcessor</strong> prend les donn=C3=
=A9es lues et les transforme avant de les =C3=A9crire. Cela peut inclure la=
 validation des donn=C3=A9es, la transformation de format, ou tout autre tr=
aitement n=C3=A9cessaire.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6218" data-end=3D"6232" class=3D"">ItemWriter</h3>
<p data-start=3D"6233" data-end=3D"6391" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99<strong data-=
start=3D"6235" data-end=3D"6249">ItemWriter</strong> est responsable de l=
=E2=80=99=C3=A9criture des donn=C3=A9es trait=C3=A9es dans une destination.=
 Cela peut =C3=AAtre une base de donn=C3=A9es, un fichier, ou un autre syst=
=C3=A8me.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6393" data-end=3D"6418" class=3D"">Cycle de vie d=E2=80=
=99un job</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6419" data-end=3D"6718">
<li data-start=3D"6419" data-end=3D"6483" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6421" data-end=3D"6483" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
421" data-end=3D"6434">Lancement</strong> : Un job est lanc=C3=A9 en appela=
nt un <code data-start=3D"6469" data-end=3D"6482">JobLauncher</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6484" data-end=3D"6564" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6486" data-end=3D"6564" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
486" data-end=3D"6509">Ex=C3=A9cution des Steps</strong> : Chaque <strong d=
ata-start=3D"6519" data-end=3D"6527">Step</strong> du job est ex=C3=A9cut=
=C3=A9 s=C3=A9quentiellement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6565" data-end=3D"6718" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6567" data-end=3D"6718" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
567" data-end=3D"6581">Fin de Job</strong> : Un job se termine lorsqu=E2=80=
=99il a ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 toutes ses =C3=A9tapes, et la r=C3=A9ussite ou l=
=E2=80=99=C3=A9chec du job est d=C3=A9termin=C3=A9e par les r=C3=A9sultats =
des =C3=A9tapes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6720" data-end=3D"6723" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6725" data-end=3D"6768" class=3D"">4. Cr=C3=A9ation d'un =
Job Spring Batch Simple</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6770" data-end=3D"6804" class=3D"">Cr=C3=A9ation d=E2=80=
=99un Job et d=E2=80=99un Step</h3>
